1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm (1. Overview) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 704 Tm (This report describes a small study of question answering over PDF documents. The study) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm (was run by the Riverbend Data Lab in March 2025. The team evaluated three retrieval) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668 Tm (methods on 120 questions. All experiments ran on a laptop with 16 GB of memory and no) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 650 Tm (GPU.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
