1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm (2. Method) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 704 Tm (Documents were split into passages of 1000 characters with an overlap of 150 characters.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm (Each passage was embedded with a MiniLM model that produces vectors of 384 dimensions.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668 Tm (Keyword search used the BM25 algorithm. The two rankings were merged with reciprocal) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 650 Tm (rank fusion using a constant of 60. The system returns at most five passages for each) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 632 Tm (question.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
