1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm (3. Results) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 704 Tm (Hybrid search reached a recall of 91 percent at five passages. Keyword search alone) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm (reached 78 percent and embedding search alone reached 85 percent. The median answer time) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668 Tm (was 4.2 seconds. The slowest question took 19 seconds. Scanned pages were the main) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 650 Tm (source of errors, causing 14 of the 31 failures.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
