1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm (4. Limitations) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 704 Tm (The study used only English and Hindi documents. Tables were converted to plain text,) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm (which sometimes lost row boundaries. The authors recommend repeating the study with at) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668 Tm (least 500 questions. No private documents were used; every file was public.) Tj
ET
endstream
