1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm (5. Data Collection) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 704 Tm (The documents came from three public sources: government reports, university course) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm (notes and open textbooks. In total the team collected 48 files with 1350 pages. Files) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668 Tm (larger than 50 megabytes were excluded. Each file was checked by two reviewers before it) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 650 Tm (was added.) Tj
