1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm (6. Question Writing) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 704 Tm (Two reviewers wrote the 120 questions by hand. Ninety questions had an answer in the) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm (documents and thirty did not. Each answerable question lists the page that holds the) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668 Tm (evidence. Questions were written in English, Hindi and a mixture of both.) Tj
