1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm (7. Answer Generation) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 704 Tm (A local language model with four billion parameters wrote the answers. The model was) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm (told to say not found when the passages did not contain the answer. The prompt allowed) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668 Tm (at most 512 tokens of output. A cloud model was never used.) Tj
ET
