1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm (8. Conclusions) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 704 Tm (Combining keyword and embedding search gave the best recall without extra cost. The) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm (system refused to answer 27 of the 30 unanswerable questions. The authors plan to test a) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668 Tm (multilingual embedding model next. The code and the questions will be released under an) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 650 Tm (open licence.) Tj
